{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q999", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "thiraimozhi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "screenplay_importance", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திரைப்படத்தின் எலும்புக்கூடாக விளங்கி, ஒவ்வொரு காட்சியிலும் யார் என்ன செய்ய வேண்டும் என்று வழிகாட்டும் வரைவு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கதைச் சுருக்கம்", "B": "பாடல் வரிகள்", "C": "திரைக்கதை (Screenplay)", "D": "விளம்பரச் சுவரொட்டி"}, "explanation": "காட்சிகளின் அமைப்பு, கதாபாத்திரங்களின் அசைவுகள், வசனங்கள் உள்ளிட்ட அனைத்தையும் துல்லியமாகத் திட்டமிடும் 'திரைக்கதை'யே படத்தின் முதுகெலும்பாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What technical blueprint acts as the structural skeleton of a film, delineating scenes, movements, and actions?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Story synopsis", "B": "Song lyrics", "C": "Screenplay (Thiraikkathai)", "D": "Promotional poster"}, "explanation": "The screenplay serves as the master structural blueprint orchestrating scenes, actions, and beats."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "s