{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1001", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "thiraimozhi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "first_tamil_silent_film", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தென்னிந்தியாவின் முதல் மௌனத் திரைப்படமான ‘கீசக வதம்’ (1916) படத்தை இயக்கிய முன்னோடித் தமிழர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆர். நடராஜ முதலியார்", "B": "கே. சுப்பிரமணியம்", "C": "ஏ.வி. மெய்யப்ப செட்டியார்", "D": "எஸ்.எஸ். வாசன்"}, "explanation": "ஆர். நடராஜ முதலியார் 1916-இல் சென்னையில் அமைத்த 'இந்தியா ஃபிலிம் கம்பெனி' மூலம் 'கீசக வதம்' என்னும் முதல் தென்னிந்திய மௌனப் படத்தைத் தயாரித்து இயக்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which pioneering filmmaker produced and directed South India's very first silent feature film 'Keechaka Vadham' in 1916?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "R. Nataraja Mudaliar", "B": "K. Subrahmanyam", "C": "A.V. Meiyappan", "D": "S.S. Vasan"}, "explanation": "R. Nataraja Mudaliar directed South India's first silent feature film 'Keechaka Vadham' in 1916."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "se