{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram_arangetru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "silambu_author_details", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘சிலப்பதிகாரம்’ என்னும் ஐம்பெருங்காப்பியத்தை இயற்றிய இளங்கோவடிகள் எந்த அரச மரபைச் சேர்ந்தவர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சேர மன்னர் மரபு (சேரன் செங்குட்டுவனின் தம்பி)", "B": "சோழ மன்னர் மரபு", "C": "பாண்டிய மன்னர் மரபு", "D": "பல்லவ மரபு"}, "explanation": "இளங்கோவடிகள் சேர மன்னன் இமயவரம்பன் நெடுஞ்சேரலாதனுக்கும் நற்சோணைக்கும் மகனாகவும், சேரன் செங்குட்டுவனின் தம்பியாகவும் பிறந்தவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which royal dynastic lineage did Ilango Adigal, the author of the epic Silappathikaram, belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Chera royal dynasty (Younger brother of Cheran Senguttuvan)", "B": "Chola royal lineage", "C": "Pandya royal dynasty", "D": "Pallava lineage"}, "explanation": "Ilango Adigal was a prince of the Chera dynasty and brother of King Cheran Senguttuvan."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "cha