{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram_arangetru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thalaikkol_gold_knots", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தலைக்கோலின் கணுக்களில் எதனைப் பூசி, இடைவெளியில் நவரத்தினங்களை இழைத்திருப்பர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சாம்பூநதம் என்னும் உயர்ந்த பொன் தகடு", "B": "வெள்ளித் தகடு", "C": "செப்புத் தகடு", "D": "பித்தளைத் தகடு"}, "explanation": "தலைக்கோலின் கணுக்களில் 'சாம்பூநதம்' என்னும் மிக உயர்ந்த வகைப் பொன்னைப் பூசி, இடையே உள்ள பகுதிகளில் ஒன்பது மணிகளையும் பதித்திருப்பர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "With which premier quality of refined gold were the nodal joints of the Thalaikkol ceremonial staff plated?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Jambunatha gold (Saamboonatham)", "B": "Silver alloy", "C": "Copper plating", "D": "Brass sheeting"}, "explanation": "The knots of the bamboo scepter were encased in pristine Jambunatha gold inlaid with nine precious gems."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 137", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 6", "Poetry", "Saamboonatham Gold"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram_arangetru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aadal_aasaan_grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிலப்பதிகார அரங்கேற்று காதையில் ‘நாட்டிய ஆசிரியன்’ (ஆடலாசான்) பெற்றிருக்க வேண்டிய முதன்மைத் தகுதியாகக் கூறப்படுவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரண்மனையில் வாழ்வது மட்டுமே", "B": "தேசியக் கூத்து, மார்க்கக் கூத்து என்னும் இருவகைக் கூத்துகளின் இலக்கணங்களையும் அவற்றின் வேறுபாடுகளையும் நன்கு உணர்ந்திருத்தல்", "C": "பாட்டு மட்டுமே பாடுவது", "D": "வாள் வீச்சு தெரிந்திருப்பது"}, "explanation": "நாட்டு மரபு, செவ்வியல் மரபு ஆகிய இருவகைக் கூத்துகளின் இலக்கண அமைதிகளையும், அவற்றின் அங்க அசைவுகளையும் பிழையின்றி இயக்கும் புலமையே ஆடலாசானின் தகுதியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What primary mastery defined the Natyacharya (Aadalaasaan / Dance Master) in Silappathikaram's Arangetru Kaathai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Palace courtier status only", "B": "Profound mastery over Desi and Marga dance traditions and their precise choreographic distinctions", "C": "Vocal singing alone", "D": "Swordsmanship proficiency"}, "explanation": "The Dance Master had to master the dual traditions of dance (Desi and Margi) and their micro-rhythms."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 136", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 6", "Poetry", "Aadalaasaan Qualification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram_arangetru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "isai_aasaan_grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆடலுக்குரிய பாடலைப் பாடும் ‘இசை ஆசிரியன்’ (பாடல் ஆசிரியன்) எவற்றில் வல்லவனாக இருக்க வேண்டும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நடனம் ஆடுவதில் மட்டும்", "B": "ஆடரங்கு அமைப்பதில் மட்டும்", "C": "குழல், யாழ் ஆகியவற்றின் இசைக்கு ஏற்பக் குரலைச் சுருதி சேர்த்து, பிழையின்றிப் பண்ணமைத்துப் பாடுவதில்", "D": "தலைக்கோல் தாங்குவதில்"}, "explanation": "இசை ஆசிரியன் இயல், இசை நூல்களை ஆய்ந்து, வாத்தியக் கருவிகளின் ஓசையோடு தன் சாரீரம் ஒன்றிப் பிழையின்றிப் பாடும் இசைவல்லுநனாக இருக்க வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What competence distinguished the Music Master (Isai Aasaan / Vocal Accompanist) in the dance ensemble?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Solo physical dancing", "B": "Stage building", "C": "Modulating vocal microtones in flawless pitch harmony with flute and lute without rhythmic flaws", "D": "Bearing the scepter"}, "explanation": "The Music Master was responsible for harmonizing the vocal line precisely with the flute and lute."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publishe