{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "nadigar_thilagam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "honorary_mayor_niagara", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1960-இல் அமெரிக்க சுற்றுப்பயணத்தின் போது, அமெரிக்காவின் எந்த புகழ்பெற்ற நகரம் சிவாஜி கணேசனுக்கு 'ஒரு நாள் மேயர்' (Honorary Mayor) கௌரவத்தை வழங்கியது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நியூயார்க்", "B": "வாஷிங்டன்", "C": "லாஸ் ஏஞ்சல்ஸ்", "D": "நயாகரா நீர்வீழ்ச்சி நகரம் (Niagara Falls)"}, "explanation": "1960-இல் அமெரிக்க அரசாங்கத்தின் அழைப்பின் பேரில் சென்ற சிவாஜி கணேசனுக்கு நயாகரா நகரத்தின் ஒரு நாள் மேயராகும் தனிப்பெரும் கௌரவம் வழங்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which American municipality conferred the unique distinction of 'Honorary Mayor for One Day' upon Sivaji Ganesan during his 1960 tour?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "New York City", "B": "Washington D.C.", "C": "Los Angeles", "D": "City of Niagara Falls"}, "explanation": "The City of Niagara Falls presented Sivaji Ganesan with the Golden Key to the City, naming him Honorary Mayor for a day."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 141, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 141", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 6", "Supplementary", "Niagara Mayor"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "nadigar_thilagam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "marlon_brando_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "“சிவாஜி கணேசனைப் போல என்னால் நடிக்க முடியாது; அவர் ஒரு நடிப்புப் பல்கலைக்கழகம்” என்று வியந்து பாராட்டிய உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற ஹாலிவுட் நடிகர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மார்லன் பிராண்டோ (Marlon Brando)", "B": "சார்லி சாப்ளின்", "C": "ராபர்ட் டி நீரோ", "D": "கிளின்ட் ஈஸ்ட்வுட்"}, "explanation": "அமெரிக்காவின் தி காட்பாதர் படப் புகழ்பெற்ற ஹாலிவுட் மேதை மார்லன் பிராண்டோ, சிவாஜியின் வியத்தகு நடிப்புத் திறனைக் கண்டு இவ்வாறு போற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which legendary Hollywood actor marveled at Sivaji's emotional virtuosity proclaiming 'He can act like me, but I cannot act like him'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Marlon Brando", "B": "Charlie Chaplin", "C": "Robert De Niro", "D": "Clint Eastwood"}, "explanation": "Marlon Brando famously praised Sivaji Ganesan's acting range and technical genius."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "pa