{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_part2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "evvathu_uraivathu_ulagam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘எவ்வ துறைவது உலகம் உலகத்தோடு, அவ்வ துறைவ தறிவு’ - இக்குறள் கற்பிக்கும் வாழ்க்கை நெறி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காட்டில் சென்று வாழ்வது", "B": "தனியாக ஒதுங்கி வாழ்வது", "C": "பிறரைப் புறக்கணிப்பது", "D": "உலகத்து உயர்ந்த சான்றோர்கள் எவ்வாறு நெறியோடு வாழ்கிறார்களோ, அவர்களோடு இணைந்து ஒத்துப் பொருந்தி வாழ்வது"}, "explanation": "உலகத்து உயர்ந்த நல்லோரின் வாழ்க்கை முறையை உணர்ந்து, அவர்களோடு முரண்படாமல் சமூகத்தோடு இசைந்து வாழ்வதே அறிவுடைமையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What practical social wisdom is imparted by 'Evvathu uraivathu ulagam ulakaththodu avvathu uraivathu arivu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Retiring to hermit caves", "B": "Living in cynical isolation", "C": "Ignoring social customs", "D": "Living in harmonious conformity with the enlightened, cultured norms of the wise world"}, "explanation": "Wisdom lives in harmony with the enlightened standards of civilized society."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 148, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 148", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 6", "Thirukkural", "Social Harmony"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_part2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "seiyarkariya_yaavula_natpin", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘செயற்கரிய யாவுள நட்பின் அதுபோல், வினைக்கரிய யாவுள காப்பு’ - இக்குறள் நட்பின் எத்தகைய சிறப்பைப் பேசுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செய்வதற்கு அரிய பேறு நட்பைப் போன்றது வேறில்லை; செயல்களுக்குத் துணையாக நின்று காக்கும் சிறந்த பாதுகாப்பும் வேறில்லை", "B": "நட்பினால் பயனில்லை", "C": "பகைமையே சிறந்தது", "D": "தனிமையே பாதுகாப்பு"}, "explanation": "ஒருவன் பெற்றுக்கொள்வதற்கு நட்பைப் போன்ற அரிய பேறு உலகில் எதுவுமில்லை; துன்பங்கள் நேராமல் காக்கும் தலைசிறந்த கவசமும் நட்பைப் போன்று வேறொன்றுமில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does the Kural 'Seiyarkariya yaavula natpin athupol vinaikkariya yaavula kaappu' extol authentic friendship?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nothing is rarer to attain than true friendship, and no defense provides greater fortification against adversity", "B": "Friendship is unhelpful", "C": "Enmity is preferable", "D": "Solitude is safest"}, "explanation": "True friendship is the rarest blessing and the strongest shield against life's tribulations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 149, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 149", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 6", "Thirukkural", "Friendship Value"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_part2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "niraineera_neeravar_kenmai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நிறைநீர நீரவர் கேண்மை பிறைமதிப், பின்னீர பேதையார் நட்பு’ - இக்குறளில் நற்குணமுடையாரின் நட்பு எதனோடு ஒப்பிடப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தேய்பிறை போல", "B": "வளர்பிறை போல நாளுக்கு நாள் பெருகுவது (நிறைநீர)", "C": "அமாவாசை போல", "D": "மின்னல் போல"}, "explanation": "பண்புடையாரின் நட்பு வளர்பிறை போல நாளுக்கு நாள் வளரும்; அறிவில்லாத பேதைகளின் நட்பு தேய்பிறை போல நாளுக்கு நாள் தேய்ந்து அழியும் என்கிறார் வள்ளுவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the verse 'Niraineera neeravar kenmai...', to what is the friendship of virtuous noble companions compared?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The waning crescent moon", "B": "The waxing moon growing fuller and brighter day by day", "C": "The dark new moon", "D": "A flash of lightning"}, "explanation": "Virtuous friendship grows like the waxing moon, while foolish friendship shrinks like the waning moon."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 149, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 149", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 6", "Thirukkural", "Waxing Moon Friendship"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u6_q1147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_part2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "inambondru_inamallaar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இனம்போன்று இனமல்லார் கேண்மை மகளிர், மனம்போல வேறு படும்’ - இக்குறள் தீய நட்பைப் பற்றிக் கூறும் எச்சரிக்கை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைவரிடமும் நட்பு கொள்ள வேண்டும்", "B": "நட்பைப் பாராட்ட வேண்டும்", "C": "நண்பர்போல நடித்து உள்ளத்தில் நல்ல எண்ணம் இல்லாதவர்களின் நட்பு, உள்ளொன்று வைத்துப் புறமொன்று பேசும் விலைமகளிரின் மனம் போல் மாறிவிடும்", "D": "நட்பிற்கு எல்லையே இல்லை"}, "explanation": "நண்பனைப் போல வெளிவேடமிட்டு உண்மையில் நல்லவர்களாக இல்லாதவரின் நட்பு, விலைமகளிரின் மனத்தைப் போலச் சுயநலத்திற்கு ஏற்ப மாறி ஏமாற்றிவிடும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What warning against duplicitous companions is delivered in 'Inambondru inamallaar kenmai makalir manambola vaeru padum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Befriend everyone indiscriminately", "B": "Praise all associates", "C": "Hypocrites feigning loyalty alter their disposition mercurially to serve mercenary self-interest", "D": "Friendship is boundless"}, "explanation": "The false friendship of hypocrites shifts mercurially to exploit selfish ends."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "sourc